      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: LBL_ALTAR_SCENE_PREVIEW_RESOURCE_RECOVERY
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Xem trước tài nguyên thu hồi
      - Preview
      - ดูทรัพยากรที่กู้คืน.
      - 回收資源預覽
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: LBL_ALTAR_SCENE_RETURN_UPPER
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - TƯỚNG HOÀN TRẢ
      - Reset Hero
      - รีเซ็ตฮีโร่
      - 重生英雄
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ALTAR_SCENE_CAN_NOT_ALTAR_ALL_HERO
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Bạn không thể huyết tế toàn bộ thuyền viên của mình
      - You can't disassemble all of your heroes
      - คุณไม่สามารถใช้เลือดให้ลูกเรือทั้งหมดของคุณได้.
      - 您不能將您的所有船員進行血祭
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ALTAR_SCENE_DESC_ALTAR_HAS_HERO_HIGHER_THAN_3_STAR
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Có thuyền viên cao hơn 3 sao trong danh sách huyết tế. Bạn có chắc chắn?
      - You have chosen 4 Star+ hero. Do you want to continue?
      - มีลูกเรือมากกว่า 3 ดาวในรายชื่อการใช้เลือด. คุณแน่ใจหรือไม่?
      - 血祭名單中有高於3星的船員，你確定繼續？
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ALTAR_SCENE_DESC_RETURN_HERO
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '* Hoàn trả tướng về cấp độ 1. Khi hoàn trả sẽ nhận lại được toàn bộ nguyên liệu đã cung cấp '
      - '* Reset hero to level 1.All resources used to level the hero up shall be returned.'
      - '* รีเซ็ตฮีโร่กลับสู่ระดับ 1.เมื่อรีเซ็ตจะได้รับคืนทรัพยากรทั้งหมด.'
      - '*重生英雄到1級。 重生時可獲得已消耗的全部材料'
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ALTAR_SCENE_DESC_RETURN_LEVEL_1
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Thuyền viên trên sẽ đưa về trạng thái level 1
      - The crew member will return to level 1 status
      - ลูกเรือจะถูกเอากลับไปยัง สถานะเลเวล1
      - 以上的船員會重置回1級
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ALTAR_SCENE_DESC_UNLOCK_HERO
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Thuyền trưởng có muốn mở khóa?
      - Do you want to unlock?
      - กัปตันต้องการปลดล็อคไหม?
      - 船長是否要解鎖？
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ALTAR_SCENE_LIST_HERO_ALTAR_FULL
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Số tướng huyết tế đã đầy
      - Hero list was full
      - จำนวนฮีโร่ใช้เลือกได้เต็มแล้ว.
      - 血祭的英雄數量已滿
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ALTAR_SCENE_PLS_SELECT_HERO
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Hãy chọn thuyền viên
      - Please select a hero
      - โปรดเลือกลูกเรือ.
      - 請選擇船員
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ALTAR_SCENE_PLS_SELECT_HERO_ALTAR
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Bạn chưa chọn tướng huyết tế
      - You have not selected any hero!
      - คุณยังไม่ได้เลือกฮีโร่ให้เลือด!
      - 您還沒選擇要血祭的英雄
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ALTAR_SCENE_SELECT_MIN
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Chọn ít nhất
      - Please select at least
      - เลือกน้อยสุด.
      - 請至少選擇
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
